# One line of a RINEX 3.05 or 4.01 GNSS observation file: a header line by its label, an epoch line, or an
# observation line. Every value is its column text. Written by tools/gen/rinex-pack.py; do not edit by hand.
format        rinex-obs-line
version       0.1.0
distribution  public
source        "IGS/RTCM RINEX WG, RINEX The Receiver Independent Exchange Format Version 4.01, 10 July 2023, https://files.igs.org/pub/data/format/rinex_4.01.pdf (sha256 5e917eb6d2224021c5f05adb333b5311b6cde0f58c3ca4e0ae5871ccd15ce0c8), Tables A2, A3, A7, A9 and A30-A34; and Version 3.05, https://files.igs.org/pub/data/format/rinex305.pdf (sha256 05de6c898e1cf4102d6d0ef8b2710a98a16a5105c49a6d972757d647c7593918); no licence stated (IGS terms of use: open use with attribution); layouts restated"
